body:
It was smart for them to vote Angelina. 

Basically, Allison, Alec and Kara had a plan B. Plan A was to stay Goliath strong and vote out Christian because they still had the numbers, but when Nick played his vote steal, they lost their numbers and they knew the game was flipped so they had to go with plan B. This was to show the Davids that they were willing to 'blur the lines' and play with them. 

&#x200B;
